    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: October 13, 2026</p>
    
    <p>Your privacy is of paramount importance to us. This Privacy Policy describes how Anchor ("we", "our") collects, uses, and protects information when you use our mobile application.</p>

    <h2>1. Data Collection and Usage</h2>
    <p>Anchor is designed to work entirely on your device. All data related to archery match scores, settings, and user preferences is stored <strong>exclusively locally on your device</strong>.</p>
    <p>We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal data or match scores to external servers or cloud storage.</p>

    <h2>2. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>The application uses standard libraries (such as audio plugins and system preferences) that operate locally without tracking user activities for advertising or profiling purposes.</p>

    <h2>3. Security</h2>
    <p>Since your data remains on your device, its security is protected by your phone's native security systems (passcode, Face ID / Touch ID).</p>

    <h2>4. Contact</h2>
    <p>For any questions or concerns regarding this policy, you can contact us through the app's support channels.</p>
